            "review_text": "Drew F\nForrestfield, Australia8 contributions\n1\nPoor service and average food\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI waited 5-10 minutes before anyone could bother giving me a menu. I ordered fried fish and chips for 140000 dong which I had to wait 25 minutes for when there were only one or two other customers in the restaurant. When I finally received my dish the fish was undercooked and unseasoned, kind of tasted like they had found a dead fish on the side of the beach. While waiting for my dish a lady that was obviously a friend of the owners would come in and out trying to sell us wallets. Very disappointed by the poor service and food quality and would not recommend going there.\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2018",
